@startuml
title Figure 9a — Authentication and grounding failure
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 48

actor Operator
participant "UI + HTTP\nboundary" as Boundary
participant "Analysis\napplication" as Analysis
participant "PolicyKnowledgePort" as Policy

Operator -> Boundary : protected analysis action
alt unauthenticated
  Boundary --> Operator : reject / redirect
else authenticated
  Boundary -> Analysis : analyze(customerId, OperatorId)
  Analysis -> Policy : retrieveRelevant(context)
  alt no relevant evidence
    Policy --> Analysis : explicit no-evidence
    Analysis --> Boundary : insufficient grounding
    Boundary --> Operator : not grounded / not completed
  else evidence available
    Policy --> Analysis : PolicyEvidence[] with provenance
  end
end

note right of Analysis
  AC-RAG-002 forbids fabricated grounding provenance.
  Missing evidence cannot fall through into a completed grounded analysis.
end note
@enduml
